Tabler Icons v3.49.0 (https://github.com/tabler/tabler-icons, tag v3.49.0), MIT, LICENSE
beside this file. Only the glyphs the chrome draws are kept. Every glyph has its comment
header dropped and its markup put on one line. Each outline glyph is redrawn at stroke-width
1.75 in place of 2, the chrome's weight (docs/decisions/ui.md, "The design system starts from
MonoCode's"). A filled glyph is named `<name>-filled.svg`. Nothing else is changed.

